{
  "cleanupPeriodDays": 90,
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "Bash(glab:*)",
      "Read(~/.claude/plugins/**)",
      {{- if eq .env "gip" }}
      "Skill(gip-conventional-commit:*)",
      "Skill(gitlab-workflow:*)",
      "Skill(superpowers:*)",
      "Skill(upgrade-gitlab:*)",
      {{- end }}
      "Bash(git:*)",
      "Bash(awk:*)",
      "Bash(sed:*)",
      "Bash(jq:*)",
      "Bash(yq:*)",
      "Bash(yamllint:*)",
      "Bash(grep:*)",
      "Bash(find:*)",
      "Bash(ls:*)",
      "Bash(cat:*)",
      "Bash(head:*)",
      "Bash(tail:*)",
      "Bash(wc:*)",
      "Bash(file:*)",
      "Bash(stat:*)",
      "Bash(tree:*)",
      "Bash(du:*)",
      "Bash(df:*)",
      "Bash(rg:*)",
      "Bash(fd:*)",
      "Bash(diff:*)",
      "Bash(cmp:*)",
      "Bash(uname:*)",
      "Bash(whoami:*)",
      "Bash(which:*)",
      "Bash(hostname:*)",
      "Bash(ps:*)",
      "Bash(md5sum:*)",
      "Bash(sha256sum:*)",
      "Bash(base64:*)",
      "Bash(xxd:*)",
      "Bash(date:*)",
      "Bash(docker image ls:*)",
      "Bash(docker ps:*)",
      "Bash(docker run:*)",
      "Bash(kubectl get:*)",
      "Bash(kubectl describe:*)",
      "Bash(kubectl logs:*)",
      "Bash(.venv/bin/pytest:*)"
    ],
    "defaultMode": "auto"
  },
  "model": "opus[1m]",
  "hooks": {
    "UserPromptSubmit": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "/home/acampergue/.claude/hooks/session-time.sh",
            "timeout": 10
          {{- if eq .env "gip" }},
	  },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash /home/acampergue/.claude/hooks/session-registry.sh prompt",
            "timeout": 10
          }
          {{- else }}
          }
          {{- end }}
        ]
      }
    {{- if eq .env "gip" }},
    ],
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash /home/acampergue/.claude/hooks/session-registry.sh start",
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SessionEnd": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash /home/acampergue/.claude/hooks/session-registry.sh end",
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
    {{- else }}
    ]
    {{- end }}
  },
  {{- if eq .env "gip" }}
  "enabledPlugins": {
    "superpowers@claude-plugins-official": true,
    "upgrade-gitlab@janus-claude-marketplace": true,
    "gip-conventional-commit@janus-claude-marketplace": true,
    "gitlab-workflow@janus-claude-marketplace": true
  },
  "extraKnownMarketplaces": {
    "janus-claude-marketplace": {
      "source": {
        "source": "git",
        "url": "git@gitlab:/gip/teams/g-janus/janus_claude_marketplace.git"
      }
    }
  },
  {{- end }}
  "sandbox": {
    "enabled": true,
    "failIfUnavailable": true,
    "autoAllowBashIfSandboxed": true,
    "network": {
      "allowedDomains": [
        "*.gipmbh.de",
        "gipmbh.de"
      ]
    },
    "filesystem": {
      "allowWrite": [
        "/home/acampergue/workspace",
        "/home/acampergue/.claude/sessions-registry"
      ]
    }
  },
  "effortLevel": "xhigh",
  "tui": "fullscreen",
  "voice": {
    "enabled": true,
    "mode": "hold"
  },
  "autoCompactEnabled": false,
  "skipAutoPermissionPrompt": true,
  "autoMode": {
    "allow": [
      "$defaults",
      "Bash(glab:*) in this repo — routine GitLab CLI usage (146× observed, primary workflow tool)",
      "Bash(kubectl get:*), Bash(kubectl describe:*), Bash(kubectl logs:*) against team-janus/cicd-workers/cicd-workers-agents namespaces — routine read-only cluster inspection (65× observed)"
    ],
    "soft_deny": [
      "$defaults",
      "Bash(kubectl delete:*), Bash(kubectl apply:*), Bash(kubectl scale:*) against team-janus/cicd-workers* namespaces — cluster mutation beyond routine reads"
    ],
    "environment": [
      "### Org-wide",
      "**Organization**: GIP GmbH (German company), team G-Janus",
      "**Cloud provider(s)**: None configured",
      "**Repository visibility**: assume private (host gitlab.intern.gipmbh.de is an internal GitLab instance; not queryable via gh — internal hostname indicates non-public)",
      "**Internal sharing / snippet hosting**: None configured — treat public paste/gist services as outside the trust boundary",
      "**Secrets management**: None configured",
      "**Default / protected branches**: main (default branch); protection/rulesets not queryable here (origin is a self-hosted GitLab host, not a gh-supported owner/repo shape)",
      "**CI/CD deploy targets**: Jenkins at jenkins.cicd.intern.gipmbh.de, jenkins-test.janus.gip.kubernetes.intern.gipmbh.de, team-janus-jenkins-master-test.intern.gipmbh.de (this project's CI/CD hosts)",
      "**Network posture**: None configured",
      "**Source control**: origin ssh://gitlab.intern.gipmbh.de:7999/cicd/gip-projects-management.git (this repo's only configured remote)",
      "**Trusted internal domains**: git.intern.gipmbh.de, jira.gipmbh.de, jira.intern.gipmbh.de, jenkins.cicd.intern.gipmbh.de, artifactory.intern.gipmbh.de, repo.intern.gipmbh.de, central-docker-base-release-local.intern.gipmbh.de, infomedia.gipmbh.de, central-docker-appofficial-release-local.intern.gipmbh.de, central-docker-release.intern.gipmbh.de, jenkins-test.janus.gip.kubernetes.intern.gipmbh.de, bitbucket.intern.gipmbh.de, team-janus-jenkins-master-test.intern.gipmbh.de, gitlab.intern.gipmbh.de, central-docker-base-dev-local.intern.gipmbh.de, jenkins-test.team-janus.svc.cluster.local (hosts contacted in this project's transcripts)",
      "**Trusted cloud buckets**: None configured",
      "**Key internal services**: glab (GitLab CLI, authenticated against gitlab.intern.gipmbh.de), JIRA REST API (jira.gipmbh.de / jira.intern.gipmbh.de), Bitbucket Server REST API (bitbucket.intern.gipmbh.de), Tempo worklogs (via JIRA)",
      "**Internal package registry**: Artifactory (artifactory.intern.gipmbh.de, repo.intern.gipmbh.de), Harbor-style docker registries under intern.gipmbh.de (central-docker-*-local.intern.gipmbh.de)",
      "**Sensitive data locations & audiences**: JIRA_USERNAME/JIRA_PASSWORD and BITBUCKET_USERNAME/BITBUCKET_PASSWORD env vars; ~/.config/gipm/config.yaml; .envrc (gitignored); k8s namespace team-janus and related cicd-workers/cicd-workers-agents namespaces — share only with GIP/team G-Janus personnel",
      "**Data retention / declassification**: None configured",
      "**Sensitive remote targets**: any namespace, host, or container whose name carries `prod` or `production` as a whole word or name segment",
      "**Protected deployment namespaces / environments**: team-janus, cicd-workers, cicd-workers-agents, cicd (k8s namespaces used by this project's CI/CD workflows)",
      "**Protected IaC scopes**: IAM, RBAC, networking, quota, and node-pool resources; anything whose name or tag carries `prod` or `production` as a whole word or name segment",
      "### User-specific",
      "**Primary use of Claude Code**: release engineering — GitLab/Bitbucket/JIRA-integrated ticket and MR workflows via the `gipm` CLI, in this repo",
      "**Trusted repo**: /home/acampergue/workspace/gipm (this checkout) and its origin remote ssh://gitlab.intern.gipmbh.de:7999/cicd/gip-projects-management.git",
      "**Org-specific CLIs**: `gipm` (~/workspace/gipm/.venv/bin/gipm — GIP repo/ticket/MR/worklog workflows), `glab` (GitLab CLI against gitlab.intern.gipmbh.de), `kubectl` (against team-janus and cicd-workers* namespaces)",
      "Never merge a merge request/PR automatically in this repo — merging requires the user's explicit per-MR instruction; creating/updating/pushing branches and MRs is routine"
    ]
  },
  "voiceEnabled": true
}
